# the Chords page (EDIT): the chord changes of the section playing, a chord at a time: KNOB 1 the chord, 2 its root,
# 3 its type, 4 its length (the last one's End takes it away; past the last, a new one); kept with the song, saved,
# and back to the song's own with SAVE held. SEL: the next section
intro off
wait 500
expect piece 0
tap EDIT
wait 200
expect view 15
# Feel's intro: C, four bars (EN_CH: root | type << 4 | beats << 8)
expect nchords 1
expect chord0 4096
expect cslot 0
shot chords.png
# its root two up (D), minor
spin K2 2
expect chord0 4098
spin K3 1
expect chord0 4114
wait 2200
expect chordroot 2
# the root goes round: down three, B
spin K2 -3
expect chord0 4123
spin K2 1
expect chord0 4112
# a new chord after it: C minor again, two bars
spin K1 1
expect cslot 1
spin K4 3
expect nchords 2
expect chord1 2064
# its root up to Eb, major 7
spin K2 3
spin K3 2
expect chord1 2099
wait 200
shot two.png
# the first chord can't end (half a bar at the least); the last one can: taken away
spin K1 -1
spin K4 -9
expect nchords 2
expect chord0 528
spin K1 1
spin K4 -9
expect nchords 1
spin K1 1
spin K4 3
expect nchords 2
# kept after a restart
tap SAVE
wait 300
reboot
wait 500
expect piece 0
expect section 0
expect nchords 2
expect chord0 528
expect chord1 2064
# another song keeps its own; back here, still ours
turn PRESET 1
expect nchords 1
turn PRESET -1
expect nchords 2
# SAVE held: the song back to its own chords
press SAVE
wait 1700
release SAVE
expect nchords 1
expect chord0 4096
# SEL: the next section (the verse), on the next bar
tap SEL
wait 2500
expect section 1
